The nums is a list of 3, 10, 5, 25, 2, and 8.
The last is the last position of nums.
The best is 0.
For every left from 0 to last.
For every right from left plus 1 to last.
The mixed is exclusive or of item left of nums and item right of nums.
If mixed is more than best, set best to mixed.

